=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">）就是观察者模式的实现。事件发布者（Subject）会通知所有注册的监听器（Observer），使它们能够对事件进行响应。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%3A%20%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88%E4%BD%A0%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BFApplicationEvent%EF%BC%9A%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cnpublic%20class%20CustomEvent%20extends%20ApplicationEvent%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20String%20message%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20CustomEvent(Object%20source%2CString%20message)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20super(source)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20this.message%20%3Dmessage%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20String%20getMessage()%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20message%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%3A%20%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8ApplicationEventPublisher%E6%9D%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%9C%A8%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95Spring%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E7%9A%84Bean%E4%B8%AD%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5ApplicationEventPublisher%EF%BC%8C%E7%84%B6%E5%90%8E%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8publishEvent%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E3%80%82%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%40Component%5Cnpublic%20class%20CustomEventPublisher%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40Autowired%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20ApplicationEventPublisher%20applicationEventPublisher%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20void%20publishEvent(final%20String%20message)%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20CustomEvent%20customEvent%20%3D%20new%20CustomEvent(this%2C%20message)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20applicationEventPublisher.publishEvent(customEvent)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%9B%91%E5%90%AC%E5%99%A8%3A%20%E6%8E%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%9B%91%E5%90%AC%E5%99%A8%E7%B1%BB%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0ApplicationListener%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E9%87%8D%E5%86%99onApplicationEvent%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E3%80%82%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%40Component%5Cnpublic%20class%20CustomEventListener%20%20implements%20ApplicationListener%3CCustomEvent%3E%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40Override%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20void%20onApplicationEvent(CustomEvent%20event)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(%5C%22Received%20custom%20event%20-%20%5C%22%20%2B%20event.getMessage())%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YdYiy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc1be37e5\" id=\"uc1be37e5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u466f2b9f\" id=\"u466f2b9f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">7.依赖注入模式（Dependency Injection Pattern）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8f163238\" id=\"u8f163238\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">： 这是Spring框架的核心设计模式之一，通过构造函数注入、Setter方法注入或接口注入的方式，Spring实现了松耦合设计。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1ae66c2\" id=\"ud1ae66c2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue58ea40b\" id=\"ue58ea40b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">8.适配器模式（Adapter Pattern）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf8bce082\" id=\"uf8bce082\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">： Spring通过</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9f485d2d\" id=\"u9f485d2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">HandlerAdapter</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub32889cd\" id=\"ub32889cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">将不同类型的处理器统一适配到</span><span data-lake-id=\"uccea585c\" id=\"uccea585c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">DispatcherServlet</span><span data-lake-id=\"ueb49ab5f\" id=\"ueb49ab5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">，从而实现请求的处理。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u22cf1e91\" id=\"u22cf1e91\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7a323f2\" id=\"ud7a323f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">9.策略模式（Strategy Pattern）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4ca4a4dd\" id=\"u4ca4a4dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">： Spring内部使用了策略模式来实现不同的策略行为，例如Spring的事务管理使用不同的事务策略来处理事务边界。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8118521b\" id=\"u8118521b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u26b6ffbe\" id=\"u26b6ffbe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">10.组合模式（Composite Pattern）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u553421a7\" id=\"u553421a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">： Spring中使用组合模式来组合多个</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud8d90540\" id=\"ud8d90540\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(var(--nb-color-white) / var(--tw-text-opacity))\">BeanPostProcessor</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue14e9210\" id=\"ue14e9210\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">或多个Advice（在AOP中）来实现复杂的功能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u42ba4094\" id=\"u42ba4094\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73e3b548\" id=\"u73e3b548\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">这些设计模式一起工作，帮助Spring提供一个强大且灵活的开发平台，使得开发者能够构建易于维护、扩展和测试的企业级应用程序。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1507, "description": "Spring框架作为一个广泛使用的Java企业应用开发框架，使用了许多设计模式来实现其灵活性和扩展性。以下是一些在Spring中常见的设计模式：单例模式（Singleton Pattern）： Spring默认情况下，Bean是单例的。也就是说，Spring容器会确保每个Bean只有一个实例，...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:20.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:02.000Z", "id": 216261328, "status": 1}